            <label for="toggleNoPauseOnBlur">Keep running when tab loses focus</label>
            <label class="switch" for="toggleNoPauseOnBlur"><input type="checkbox" id="toggleNoPauseOnBlur"><span class="slider"></span></label>
        </div>
        <div class="panel-note">
            Some toggles need a relaunch to take effect on the current game, since
